---
// src/pages/technical/tips/index.astro
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { technicalTipsData } from '../../../data/technicalTipsData';

// Divide into Known Problems and Step-by-Step DIY User Tips
const knownProblemSlugs = [
  'dash',
  'wet',
  'wipers',
  'wishbone',
  'variator',
  'paint',
  'fuse',
  'swboot',
  'swdoor',
  'otemp',
  'powerloss',
  'idle',
  'temperature',
  'clutch',
  'ac',
  'cold',
  'winter'
];

const knownProblems = technicalTipsData.filter(t => knownProblemSlugs.includes(t.slug));
const userTips = technicalTipsData.filter(t => !knownProblemSlugs.includes(t.slug));
---

<Layout
  title="Tips & Guide Tecniche Alfa 156 (User Tips & Known Problems) | Cuore Sportivo Archive"
  description="L'archivio originale integrale di tips, problemi noti e guide passo-passo di alfa156.net per la manutenzione e risoluzione guasti su Alfa Romeo 156."
  currentPath="/technical/tips"
>
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-10">
    
    <!-- Breadcrumb -->
    <nav class="flex items-center space-x-2 text-xs font-mono text-alfa-metal-500 mb-6">
      <a href="/" class="hover:text-alfa-red-600">Home</a>
      <span>/</span>
      <a href="/technical" class="hover:text-alfa-red-600">Technical</a>
      <span>/</span>
      <span class="text-alfa-red-600 font-bold">
        <span class="lang-it">Tips & Guide</span>
        <span class="lang-en">Tips & Guides</span>
      </span>
    </nav>

    <!-- Sub-navigation Hub Bar -->
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 p-1.5 mb-8 rounded-xl bg-alfa-metal-100 dark:bg-alfa-metal-900 border border-alfa-metal-200 dark:border-alfa-metal-800 text-sm">
      <a
        href="/technical"
        class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg font-semibold text-alfa-metal-700 dark:text-alfa-metal-300 hover:text-alfa-red-600 dark:hover:text-white transition-colors"
      >
        <span class="lang-it">Specifiche Motori & Telaio</span>
        <span class="lang-en">Engine & Chassis Specs</span>
      </a>
      <a
        href="/technical/tips"
        class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg font-bold bg-alfa-red-600 text-white shadow-xs"
      >
        <span class="lang-it">Tips & Guide Passo-Passo</span>
        <span class="lang-en">Tips & DIY Guides</span>
      </a>
      <a
        href="/technical/tuning"
        class="px-4 py-2 rounded-lg font-semibold text-alfa-metal-700 dark:text-alfa-metal-300 hover:text-alfa-red-600 dark:hover:text-white transition-colors"
      >
        <span class="lang-it">Tuning & Elaborazioni</span>
        <span class="lang-en">Tuning & Handling</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Header Section with Original Intro & Service Sign -->
    <div class="border-b border-alfa-metal-200 dark:border-alfa-metal-800 pb-8 mb-10">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 items-center">
        <div class="lg:col-span-3">
          <h1 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-alfa-metal-900 dark:text-white">
            <span class="lang-it">Problemi Noti e Guide Tecniche</span>
            <span class="lang-en">Known Problems & User Tips</span>
          </h1>

          <div class="mt-4 text-base sm:text-lg text-alfa-metal-600 dark:text-alfa-metal-300 space-y-3 leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              <span class="lang-it">
                <em>"Possedere e guidare un'Alfa Romeo 156 è fantastico e stampa un grande sorriso sulla faccia di ogni proprietario! :) Ma ci sono alcune cose a cui devi fare attenzione. Ricorda che questi difetti non si verificano su ogni vettura! Se dovessimo stilare una lista simile per Audi o BMW, sembrerebbe altrettanto spaventosa."</em> — <strong>Anders</strong>
              </span>
              <span class="lang-en">
                <em>"Owning and driving an Alfa Romeo 156 is great and puts a big smile on any owners face! :) But - there are some things you should watch out for. Remember that the problems are not happening with every car! If one should make a list for Audi and BMW, it would look scary aswell."</em> — <strong>Anders</strong>
              </span>
            </p>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-alfa-metal-500 dark:text-alfa-metal-400 font-mono">
              <span class="lang-it">
                Tutte le procedure e i consigli qui riportati sono redatti per fornire aiuto. Se hai dubbi su come effettuare un'operazione, affidati a meccanici professionisti.
              </span>
              <span class="lang-en">
                Please note - the things featured here are only meant for help. If you are not sure about how you do things, leave it to the professionals! ;)
              </span>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center p-3 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-alfa-metal-900 border border-alfa-metal-200 dark:border-alfa-metal-800 shadow-xs">
          <img
            src="/images/servizio.jpg"
            alt="The Alfa Romeo Service Sign in Arma di Taggia, Italy"
            class="w-28 sm:w-32 h-auto rounded-lg shadow-inner"
          />
          <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-center text-alfa-metal-500 mt-2">
            Insegna Servizio ad Arma di Taggia (IM)
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Prominent Jump to Buyer's Guide -->
    <div class="mb-12 p-5 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-alfa-red-950/70 via-alfa-metal-900 to-alfa-metal-950 border border-alfa-red-600/40 text-white flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
      <div>
        <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-alfa-red-400">
          Risorsa Consigliata per Futuri Proprietari
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-bold">
          <span class="lang-it">Stai valutando l'acquisto di una 156 usata?</span>
          <span class="lang-en">Considering buying a used Alfa 156?</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-alfa-silver-300 mt-1">
          <span class="lang-it">Consulta la Guida all'Acquisto dedicata con la checklist a 48 punti di Posty e le scansioni di Auto Italia.</span>
          <span class="lang-en">Check out the dedicated Buyer's Guide with Posty's 48-point checklist and full Auto Italia scans.</span>
        </p>
      </div>
      <a
        href="/buyers-guide"
        class="px-4 py-2.5 rounded-lg bg-alfa-red-600 hover:bg-alfa-red-700 text-white font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider flex-shrink-0 transition-colors shadow-md"
      >
        <span class="lang-it">Vai alla Guida Acquisto →</span>
        <span class="lang-en">Open Buyer's Guide →</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- SECTION 1: The Known Problems -->
    <div class="mb-14">
      <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 mb-6">
        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-500 flex items-center justify-center font-bold">
          !
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-alfa-metal-900 dark:text-white">
            <span class="lang-it">Problemi Noti e Difetti Congeniti (Known Problems)</span>
            <span class="lang-en">Known Problems & Congenital Defects</span>
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xs font-mono text-alfa-metal-500 mt-0.5">
            <span class="lang-it">I difetti documentati e risolti storicamente dalla community di alfa156.net</span>
            <span class="lang-en">The defects documented and resolved historically by the alfa156.net community</span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
        {knownProblems.map((p) => (
          <a
            href={`/technical/tips/${p.slug}`}
            class="group p-5 rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-alfa-metal-900 border border-alfa-metal-200 dark:border-alfa-metal-800 hover:border-alfa-red-500/50 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-200 flex flex-col justify-between"
          >
            <div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
                  <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px] font-mono font-semibold bg-alfa-metal-100 dark:bg-alfa-metal-800 text-alfa-metal-600 dark:text-alfa-silver-300">
                    {p.category}
                  </span>
                  {p.images && p.images.length > 0 && (
                    <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-mono font-bold bg-amber-500/10 dark:bg-amber-400/10 text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 border border-amber-500/20">
                      📸 {p.images.length} foto
                    </span>
                  )}
                  {p.audio && p.audio.length > 0 && (
                    <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-mono font-bold bg-purple-500/10 text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400">
                      🎵 Audio
                    </span>
                  )}
                </div>
                <span class="text-xs font-mono text-alfa-red-600 dark:text-alfa-red-400 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">
                  Leggi →
                </span>
              </div>

              <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-lg text-alfa-metal-900 dark:text-white group-hover:text-alfa-red-600 dark:group-hover:text-alfa-red-400 transition-colors">
                <span class="lang-it">{p.titleIt}</span>
                <span class="lang-en">{p.titleEn}</span>
              </h3>

              <p class="text-xs text-alfa-metal-600 dark:text-alfa-metal-300 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
                <span class="lang-it">{p.summaryIt}</span>
                <span class="lang-en">{p.summaryEn}</span>
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-alfa-metal-100 dark:border-alfa-metal-800/80 text-[11px] font-mono text-alfa-metal-400">
              Autore: <span class="text-alfa-metal-700 dark:text-alfa-metal-300">{p.author}</span>
            </div>
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- SECTION 2: User Tips & Step-by-Step DIY Guides -->
    <div class="border-t border-alfa-metal-200 dark:border-alfa-metal-800 pt-12 mb-14">
      <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 mb-6">
        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-alfa-red-500/10 text-alfa-red-600 dark:text-alfa-red-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold">
          🛠
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-alfa-metal-900 dark:text-white">
            <span class="lang-it">Guide Passo-Passo e Tutorial Fotografici (User Tips)</span>
            <span class="lang-en">DIY Step-by-Step Guides & Photo Tutorials</span>
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xs font-mono text-alfa-metal-500 mt-0.5">
            <span class="lang-it">I tutorial fotografici dettagliati realizzati da Jeff Porter, Anders e dagli alfisti storici</span>
            <span class="lang-en">Detailed photo tutorials authored by Jeff Porter, Anders and vintage Alfisti</span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
        {userTips.map((tip) => (
          <a
            href={`/technical/tips/${tip.slug}`}
            class="group p-5 rounded-xl bg-white dark:bg-alfa-metal-900 border border-alfa-metal-200 dark:border-alfa-metal-800 hover:border-alfa-red-500/50 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-200 flex flex-col justify-between"
          >
            <div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
                  <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px] font-mono font-semibold bg-alfa-metal-100 dark:bg-alfa-metal-800 text-alfa-metal-600 dark:text-alfa-silver-300">
                    {tip.category}
                  </span>
                  {tip.images && tip.images.length > 0 && (
                    <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-mono font-bold bg-amber-500/10 dark:bg-amber-400/10 text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-400 border border-amber-500/20">
                      📸 {tip.images.length} foto
                    </span>
                  )}
                  {tip.download && (
                    <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-mono font-bold bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400">
                      📄 PDF
                    </span>
                  )}
                </div>
                <span class="text-xs font-mono text-alfa-red-600 dark:text-alfa-red-400 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">
                  Apri Guida →
                </span>
              </div>

              <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-base text-alfa-metal-900 dark:text-white group-hover:text-alfa-red-600 dark:group-hover:text-alfa-red-400 transition-colors">
                <span class="lang-it">{tip.titleIt}</span>
                <span class="lang-en">{tip.titleEn}</span>
              </h3>

              <p class="text-xs text-alfa-metal-600 dark:text-alfa-metal-300 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
                <span class="lang-it">{tip.summaryIt}</span>
                <span class="lang-en">{tip.summaryEn}</span>
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-alfa-metal-100 dark:border-alfa-metal-800/80 text-[11px] font-mono text-alfa-metal-400">
              Guida di: <span class="text-alfa-metal-700 dark:text-alfa-metal-300">{tip.author}</span>
            </div>
          </a>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- SECTION 3: Additional Resources (Oily Bits, Manuals) -->
    <div class="border-t border-alfa-metal-200 dark:border-alfa-metal-800 pt-10">
      <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-bold text-alfa-metal-900 dark:text-white mb-4">
        <span class="lang-it">Risorse Aggiuntive & Documentazione d'Officina</span>
        <span class="lang-en">Additional Workshop Documentation</span>
      </h3>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        <a
          href="/downloads/cleaningthrottlebody.pdf"
          download="cleaningthrottlebody.pdf"
          class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-alfa-metal-50 dark:bg-alfa-metal-900/60 border border-alfa-metal-200 dark:border-alfa-metal-800 hover:border-alfa-red-500/40 transition-colors flex items-center space-x-3"
        >
          <span class="text-2xl">📄</span>
          <div>
            <div class="text-sm font-bold text-alfa-metal-900 dark:text-white">Throttle Body Cleaning (PDF)</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-alfa-metal-500">Procedura pulizia corpo farfallato</div>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a
          href="/downloads/Alfa156Brakes.pdf"
          download="Alfa156Brakes.pdf"
          class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-alfa-metal-50 dark:bg-alfa-metal-900/60 border border-alfa-metal-200 dark:border-alfa-metal-800 hover:border-alfa-red-500/40 transition-colors flex items-center space-x-3"
        >
          <span class="text-2xl">📑</span>
          <div>
            <div class="text-sm font-bold text-alfa-metal-900 dark:text-white">Gary's Brake Guide (PDF)</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-alfa-metal-500">Guida dischi e pastiglie freni</div>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a
          href="/downloads/buttonflipkey.pdf"
          download="buttonflipkey.pdf"
          class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-alfa-metal-50 dark:bg-alfa-metal-900/60 border border-alfa-metal-200 dark:border-alfa-metal-800 hover:border-alfa-red-500/40 transition-colors flex items-center space-x-3"
        >
          <span class="text-2xl">🔑</span>
          <div>
            <div class="text-sm font-bold text-alfa-metal-900 dark:text-white">Michaeld's Button Flip Key (PDF)</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-alfa-metal-500">Conversione chiave a scatto</div>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</Layout>
